[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 14284.07, "timestamp": "03:58:04", "text": "确实在第二部分中不是"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14286.71, "timestamp": "03:58:06", "text": "第二部分，但其中一部分是我"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14290.63, "timestamp": "03:58:10", "text": "想在直播中做一件事，那就是走路"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14293.99, "timestamp": "03:58:13", "text": "最后一次来到海滩"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14296.87, "timestamp": "03:58:16", "text": "因为我明天就要离开了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14299.51, "timestamp": "03:58:19", "text": "或者明天。如果我明天就要离开，"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14301.99, "timestamp": "03:58:21", "text": "我本来会下水游一游的。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14304.59, "timestamp": "03:58:24", "text": "像静止的游泳一样"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14307.229, "timestamp": "03:58:27", "text": "东西。我的眼睛"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14310.87, "timestamp": "03:58:30", "text": "美好的。肖恩肯定。是的，我希望"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14312.63, "timestamp": "03:58:32", "text": "音质很好。如果……请告诉我。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14315.71, "timestamp": "03:58:35", "text": "音频质量不好。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14320.469, "timestamp": "03:58:40", "text": "嗨，哥们。一切都好。看看这个"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14324.229, "timestamp": "03:58:44", "text": "螃蟹之类的东西。哇，这里有螃蟹！"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 14327.11, "timestamp": "03:58:47", "text": "东西。所以，它就像一只小螃蟹。喜欢"}]